sh/22fvz4v44nsy", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/564ae05f/uploads/origins/6d13687e-4669-4877-ae84-514646072c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e905fdabf5d8209e2c2199af8a781948", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/564ae05f/uploads/origins/6d13687e-4669-4877-ae84-514646072c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e905fdabf5d8209e2c2199af8a781948, https://si.imgix.net/564ae05f/uploads/origins/6d13687e-4669-4877-ae84-514646072c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69f1d5fd3a6df1ac1f9f581790b3e66a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/564ae05f/uploads/origins/6d13687e-4669-4877-ae84-514646072c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c8c580c46231a180a9b8a8e1ec60a7d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really like your art style and was wondering if you could draw my VTuber character in your style.\nMy character is basically a party demon.  Could you draw him doing a sexy or seductive pose?\n\nHere is some references of my VTuber model - https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_wwjapKpJUB_tBZuGlRuh3Ut2V41KMpb?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c201270/uploads/origins/3bc57a58-0ee8-42d8-82e4-391b9d106e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99eacd7b60478adf8b5f78326096f196", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c201270/uploads/origins/3bc57a58-0ee8-42d8-82e4-391b9d106e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99eacd7b60478adf8b5f78326096f196, https://si.imgix.net/3c201270/uploads/origins/3bc57a58-0ee8-42d8-82e4-391b9d106e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1028594234982eb6ddbdf0054803174c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c201270/uploads/origins/3bc57a58-0ee8-42d8-82e4-391b9d106e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4b0cb0b2e6316eab75ac44deef3e70e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きです僕のOCのアロワナを描いてほしいんだ！見た目はとてもかっこいいんですが、ちょっとバカなんです。\n\n好きなように描いてください！\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/75984697_KNtU5eNHfjHyvXo.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/66551414/uploads/origins/e0930b81-d0fd-49f5-bd89-8cb20d743231?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c144cf558e1ad6bc4479273cd7ea210", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66551414/uploads/origins/e0930b81-d0fd-49f5-bd89-8cb20d743231?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c144cf558e1ad6bc4479273cd7ea210, https://si.imgix.net/66551414/uploads/origins/e0930b81-d0fd-49f5-bd89-8cb20d743231?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb08bc472ab126e7066d166708aa908f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66551414/uploads/origins/e0930b81-d0fd-49f5-bd89-8cb20d743231?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c396709e22f74870bd86304602cd631 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、来る新年に向けて、私の龍女のキャラクターであるリアンの写真を撮りたいのです。今年は中国の辰年なので、カラフルで華やかなものがいいと思っています。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/JV0qhPV", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/17fbcdc6/uploads/origins/f98f4b7c-3ffa-449d-83a4-b62069454d6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a48e6d19f2885c0e4d6e03dafc53d598", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17fbcdc6/uploads/origins/f98f4b7c-3ffa-449d-83a4-b62069454d6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a48e6d19f2885c0e4d6e03dafc53d598, https://si.imgix.net/17fbcdc6/uploads/origins/f98f4b7c-3ffa-449d-83a4-b62069454d6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=641feab6c2d04701e9433d491b659a6b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17fbcdc6/uploads/origins/f98f4b7c-3ffa-449d-83a4-b62069454d6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=646145184c7903e438e37aea1a0d6a69 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "また会ったね！\n\n新しい作品をお願いしたいと思っていました！私のキャラクター「エリス」を描いていただけませんか？ポーズや服装は問いませんし、タンクトップに短パンでも構いません！性格はちょっと飄々としていたり、冷たかったり、ちょっとやんちゃだったり。\n\n参考文献：https://imgchest.com/p/ne7b3n5gy53\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/ne7b3n5gy53", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c720ae5a/uploads/origins/1baf88a2-a377-4933-87a1-273f79f5b56b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=298f7481e759662aa178153a8d83de98", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c720ae5a/uploads/origins/1baf88a2-a377-4933-87a1-273f79f5b56b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=298f7481e759662aa178153a8d83de98, https://si.imgix.net/c720ae5a/uploads/origins/1baf88a2-a377-4933-87a1-273f79f5b56b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c97cf8d55506acf7759895b9e80adf0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c720ae5a/uploads/origins/1baf88a2-a377-4933-87a1-273f79f5b56b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6387c8230a533079565abe8cafba0f2c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I really liked the way you drew my fursona! I would love to get other art piece from you, but I would like for my character to be in a different outfit, the references are in the link below\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/d5fo7jii5dnkjlfydgy8u/h?rlkey=cnzs6wgqdrai3jl51qbvrdy7r&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/39e843a9/uploads/origins/1de20ab3-9bf9-449a-8f86-c4b27f2051f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef51b55f308ab80e522d09d9c13e2400", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/39e843a9/uploads/origins/1de20ab3-9bf9-449a-8f86-c4b27f2051f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef51b55f308ab80e522d09d9c13e2400, https://si.imgix.net/39e843a9/uploads/origins/1de20ab3-9bf9-449a-8f86-c4b27f2051f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86db0a2615876c38da41328001714edc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/39e843a9/uploads/origins/1de20ab3-9bf9-449a-8f86-c4b27f2051f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9aa2bf125b570aa9637b94888b8175c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アイリス（人間）がストレイ（猫）に見惚れている写真が欲しい。人間は猫に執着があり、過度の愛情を注いでいる。猫は疲れて負けている。その他の詳細は決めていただいて結構です。ありがとうございました。\n\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1U_1-udLC-FMywBb6Wni1D7gUsejrxHcI\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/13203107.stray", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kgim_0626/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c891930/uploads/origins/07e9a1a6-c95e-486a-a6a5-a830e4b89dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f14615095e2bd9b02eccff37717eb651", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c891930/uploads/origins/07e9a1a6-c95e-486a-a6a5-a830e4b89dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f14615095e2bd9b02eccff37717eb651, https://si.imgix.net/1c891930/uploads/origins/07e9a1a6-c95e-486a-a6a5-a830e4b89dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cf21fe84f4531d1de9bf7a4ee85ffab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c891930/uploads/origins/07e9a1a6-c95e-486a-a6a5-a830e4b89dae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b20f8c5ae513c1dbe576b4017c609bf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello KageImo! I'd like to make a commission for my OC WakaKusa, a fox in color of lemon. I'd like him to be muscular and in